From c448c24793ebd5fc02c56ca57a7a3843f430007e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shuko-apply <apply@shuko.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:25:45 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] unit C-2-debug: edits

Remove the references to the debugger - run and debug view, breakpoints, debug console, debug adapters, notebook variables view - from the remaining files. The debug member of the extension API does nothing, see extHostRemovedApi.debug.ts. IDebugService and IDebugVisualizerService are backed by the upstream NullDebugService and NullDebugVisualizerService, registered by debug.service.contribution.ts, which workbench.common.main.ts now imports. The removed debug API shapes are dropped from extHost.protocol.ts. The notebook settings notebook.variablesView and notebook.inlineValues are no longer registered, and the find keybinding of the debug console is gone.
---
